    <string name="manifesto">ASD = Anarchic Streaming Device (Ngwa Ntụgharị Egwu nke Ọgbaghara).\n\"Streaming\" si n\'ebe nchekwa gị gaa n\'ntị gị, ọ bụ nke ahụ.\n\n· A na-eji netwọk naanị maka Google Drive na TUBE, ma ọ bụrụ naanị ma ị jiri ha.\n· Enweghị akaụntụ, enweghị mgbasa ozi, enweghị nsochi.\n· Ndepụta egwu bi n\'ekwentị. Ihichapụ ha anaghị emetụ faịlụ aka.\n· ASD anaghị ehichapụ faịlụ gị ma ọlị: iji wepụ otu, jiri ekwentị ma ọ bụ Drive.\n· Ọnụahịa: 0€. Ruo mgbe ebighị ebi.</string>
